Z||000015||RICK||01-31-2000||08:22 PM||||I have had aquariums for 12 years now, I just broke down my 55 gal reef tank because I moved and didnt have time to keep up on it.  I did reset up another 55 gal but it's freshwater (less time needed).  I bought a 55 gal reef ready tank so I could still use my wet dry and the metal halids.  If any of you have a salt water set up I have a custom built (professonal built, not home made) proten skimmer that is a 48x6" reaction chamber with a 10x6 collection cup that I want to get rid of, If your interested let me know.||||reg||1
